{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51748","headline":"落韵诗（二首） 二 · 李如实","name":"落韵诗（二首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎蒸不可度，执（一作倏，又作赖）尔生凉风。\n在物诚非器，於人还有功。\n殷勤九夏内，寂寞三秋中。\n想君应有语，弃我如秋扇。\n（《监诫录》三《落韵贬》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李如实","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}